{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Turret Kingdom",
    "steam_appid": 2892930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to this mystical world</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892930/extras/3d7b4ee4a22b7637716d06902afc9a97.webp?t=1734085255\" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where ancient magic intertwines with cutting-edge technology to defend against hordes of menacing enemies. In this exhilarating tower defense game, players will embark on an epic journey to safeguard the peaceful Hilu Village from the relentless onslaught of foes using powerful magic-powered turrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the guardian of Hilu Village, you'll strategically place an array of enchanting turrets across multiple environments, each with its own unique challenges and strategic advantages. From lush forests to treacherous deserts and icy tundras, every landscape presents new obstacles to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892930/extras/9c1b4e7c6cebe23a853a43d550a138c8.avif?t=1734085255\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, for the enemies advancing upon Hilu Village are no ordinary foes. They come in a variety of elemental forms, each with their own strengths and weaknesses. Fire-breathing dragons, frosty ice giants, and electrifying storm elementals are just a few of the formidable adversaries you'll encounter on your quest to protect the village. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for thrilling encounters with powerful elemental bosses, each possessing devastating abilities and requiring cunning tactics to defeat. Only by mastering the intricacies of magic and tower placement will you emerge victorious against these formidable adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stunning visuals, immersive gameplay, and a wealth of strategic depth, Hilu Village Defense offers an unforgettable tower defense experience unlike any other. Are you ready to harness the power of magic and defend Hilu Village against the forces of darkness? The fate of the village rests in your hands.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to this mystical world</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892930/extras/3d7b4ee4a22b7637716d06902afc9a97.webp?t=1734085255\" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where ancient magic intertwines with cutting-edge technology to defend against hordes of menacing enemies. In this exhilarating tower defense game, players will embark on an epic journey to safeguard the peaceful Hilu Village from the relentless onslaught of foes using powerful magic-powered turrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the guardian of Hilu Village, you'll strategically place an array of enchanting turrets across multiple environments, each with its own unique challenges and strategic advantages. From lush forests to treacherous deserts and icy tundras, every landscape presents new obstacles to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892930/extras/9c1b4e7c6cebe23a853a43d550a138c8.avif?t=1734085255\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, for the enemies advancing upon Hilu Village are no ordinary foes. They come in a variety of elemental forms, each with their own strengths and weaknesses. Fire-breathing dragons, frosty ice giants, and electrifying storm elementals are just a few of the formidable adversaries you'll encounter on your quest to protect the village. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for thrilling encounters with powerful elemental bosses, each possessing devastating abilities and requiring cunning tactics to defeat. Only by mastering the intricacies of magic and tower placement will you emerge victorious against these formidable adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stunning visuals, immersive gameplay, and a wealth of strategic depth, Hilu Village Defense offers an unforgettable tower defense experience unlike any other. Are you ready to harness the power of magic and defend Hilu Village against the forces of darkness? The fate of the village rests in your hands.</p>",
    "short_description": "Defend the serene Hilu Village against relentless hordes of elemental enemies in this thrilling tower defense game. Utilize magic-powered turrets strategically across diverse environments, facing off against fiery dragons, icy giants, and electrifying storm elementals.",
